{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27254","headline":"风不鸣条 · 章孝标","name":"风不鸣条","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旭日悬清景，微风在绿条。\n入松声不发，过柳影空摇。\n长养应潜变，扶疎每暗飘。\n有林时杳杳，无树蹔萧萧。\n慢逐清烟散，轻和瑞气饶。\n丰年知有待，歌咏美唐尧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章孝标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27254.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27254","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}